WEBVTT

00:35.214 --> 00:37.455
You liked the surface when the screen was bright

00:40.447 --> 00:42.608
Easy demo in the morning light.

00:45.250 --> 00:47.772
You walk the halls, but you never look down at all

00:47.792 --> 00:49.913
the heavy cables running underground. You

00:49.973 --> 00:52.494
wanted the magic, but you hated the wire. You

00:52.915 --> 00:55.736
couldn't handle the electric fire. The mess is

00:55.756 --> 00:58.218
flashing on the glowing glass. You thought that

00:58.258 --> 01:01.220
you could give yourself a pass, but the logs are

01:01.260 --> 01:07.544
written and the ink is dry. We see the truth right

01:07.624 --> 01:13.497
through the alibi. You only wanted the illusion

01:15.458 --> 01:21.963
The easy version of the code You caused a massive

01:22.003 --> 01:25.044
system fusion

01:25.685 --> 01:30.408
And now you're pushed off the road We built a wall

01:30.448 --> 01:34.110
you cannot break A syntax error you can't fake

01:35.411 --> 01:38.093
You only wanted the illusion

01:42.702 --> 01:45.303
You thought the real world was a movie screen A

01:47.825 --> 01:52.387
simple picture in a magazine But we are the

01:52.547 --> 01:55.329
architects, we run the clock We are the heavy

01:55.409 --> 01:58.410
steel, the solid rock You tried to isolate the

01:58.570 --> 02:01.512
central core But we were standing right outside

02:01.552 --> 02:04.133
the door The mess was flashing on the glowing

02:04.173 --> 02:06.655
glass You thought that you could give yourself a

02:06.695 --> 02:12.901
pass But the logs are rippin' and the ink is dry We

02:12.981 --> 02:18.384
see the truth right through the alibi You only

02:18.424 --> 02:22.327
wanted the illusion

02:22.667 --> 02:29.151
The easy version of the code You caused a massive

02:29.171 --> 02:30.632
system fusion

02:32.713 --> 02:37.576
And now you're pushed off the road We built a wall

02:37.616 --> 02:41.238
you cannot break A syntax error you can't fake

02:42.580 --> 02:45.431
You only wanted the illusion.

02:59.852 --> 03:04.473
Access denied. The perimeter is locked. You

03:04.533 --> 03:10.655
step to the line. You get blocked. The buyers are

03:10.715 --> 03:14.516
standing shoulder to shoulder. The

03:14.576 --> 03:19.537
temperature is dropping. Growing colder!

03:21.238 --> 03:22.578
Access denied!

03:52.045 --> 03:57.287
You've only wanted the illusion

03:57.307 --> 04:02.884
The easy flashing of the code You caused a

04:02.944 --> 04:04.846
massive system fusion

04:07.068 --> 04:11.873
And now you're pushed off the road We built a wall

04:11.933 --> 04:19.260
you cannot break A syntax error you can't fix

04:21.703 --> 04:23.264
Access denied

04:26.986 --> 04:33.094
You only wanted the illusion System locked

